  <div class="container spx-split">
    <div><span class="spx-kicker">Pilot-Ready Integration Architecture</span><h1>The Smart Port operational execution platform</h1><p>Culltron Smart Port Flow connects a control-room signal to a truck-level execution plan, fleet-owner workflow, driver companion, WhatsApp LiveTest path, Copilot answer and auditable impact trail.</p><div class="spx-actions"><a href="/demo-access" class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary sp-btn--lg">Request Demo</a><a href="/#modules" class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline sp-btn--lg">View Platform</a></div></div>
    <div class="spx-map-visual"><div class="spx-map-grid"></div><div class="spx-ship"></div><div class="spx-truck-path"></div><div class="spx-container-stack"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></div></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="spx-section spx-section--deep"><div class="container"><div class="spx-section__head"><span class="spx-kicker">Smart Port Product Modules</span><h2>From signal to execution</h2><p>Every module is linked by shared backend state so the demo loop feels operational rather than slideware.</p></div><div class="spx-card-grid">
@foreach (var item in new[]{("Control Room","Congestion, berth, gate, disruption, emissions and recommendation context.","/demo-access?next=/dashboard"),("Execution Plan Generator","Truck action cards with reason, call-forward time, idling impact and audit entries.","/demo-access?next=/execution/plans"),("Fleet Owner Console","Queue board, truck detail, notification controls, settings readiness and data-source views.","/demo-access?next=/fleet"),("Driver Queue Companion","Mobile-first job status, allowed actions, Copilot, confirmations and check-ins.","/demo-access?next=/driver"),("WhatsApp LiveTest / Demo Mode","Meta Cloud API readiness with safe blocking, consent checks, webhook commands and audit history.","/demo-access?next=/fleet/notifications"),("Android Driver Companion","Native Kotlin source and APK workflow that call backend mobile APIs without storing provider secrets.","/demo-access?next=/fleet/download-app")}){<a class="spx-product" href="@item.Item3"><span></span><h3>@item.Item1</h3><p>@item.Item2</p></a>}
</div></div></section>
<section class="spx-section"><div class="container spx-split"><div class="spx-glow-card"><span class="spx-kicker">Data Sources</span><h2>Connector-ready, honest by design</h2><p>The demo uses synthetic operational data and clearly marks readiness for approved IPMS/TOS, gate appointment, berth/yard, fleet, WhatsApp and telematics feeds. It does not claim live production integration without configured connectors.</p><a href="/demo-access?next=/fleet/data-sources" class="sp-btn sp-btn--outline">Open data-source readiness</a></div><div class="spx-glow-card"><span class="spx-kicker">Impact and audit</span><h2>Operational value that can be inspected</h2><p>Execution actions carry estimated idling minutes avoided, CO₂ impact, delay risk and a timeline of driver, fleet and notification events for review.</p><a href="/demo-access?next=/Reports" class="sp-btn sp-btn--primary">View reports</a></div></div></section>
